    <div class="hero-foot"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i> Free shipping over $100</span><span><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Secure demo checkout</span><span><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> Easy returns</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
